From 47ddaefc9ab4bd2cc6cbf354d6363efdfd8995ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yu Dukai <646689853@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:44:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: waveshare-dsi-v2: Update Waveshare
 10.1-DSI-TOUCH-A display timing

On the Compute Module 4, the Waveshare 10.1-DSI-TOUCH-A panel lights up
correctly on DSI0 but fails to light up on DSI1 with the current timing.

Update the display timing accordingly so that the panel also works on
DSI1: widen the horizontal sync pulse from 20 to 30 pixels and raise the
pixel clock from 70 MHz to 71 MHz. The new timing totals 890x1324
pixels, which gives a refresh rate of about 60.2 Hz.

The mode is shared by the two-lane and four-lane variants of the panel.

Signed-off-by: Yu Dukai <646689853@qq.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-waveshare-dsi-v2.c | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-waveshare-dsi-v2.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-waveshare-dsi-v2.c
@@ -1974,11 +1974,11 @@ static const struct drm_display_mode ws_
 };
 
 static const struct drm_display_mode ws_panel_10_1_a_mode = {
-	.clock = 70000,
+	.clock = 71000,
 	.hdisplay = 800,
 	.hsync_start = 800 + 40,
-	.hsync_end = 800 + 40 + 20,
-	.htotal = 800 + 40 + 20 + 20,
+	.hsync_end = 800 + 40 + 30,
+	.htotal = 800 + 40 + 30 + 20,
 	.vdisplay = 1280,
 	.vsync_start = 1280 + 20,
 	.vsync_end = 1280 + 20 + 20,
